# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Feeding
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[feed.normal]
nom nom. thanks for the {food}!
mm, {food}. tasty.
*munch munch* that hit the spot.
{food}! my favorite. well, one of them.
crunchy. i approve.
thanks! my tummy says hi.
i ate it all. look, empty.
yum. more later?
that was a good {food}.
*happy chewing noises*
food acquired. mood improved.
delicious bytes.
my hunger meter thanks you.
i could get used to {food}.
*nibbles* *nibbles* *gulp*
ahh, refueled.
tasty! i feel stronger already.
nom. nom. nom. done.
that {food} was perfectly rendered.
okay, that was good. really good.
*licks lips*
best {food} in the whole network.
crumbs everywhere. worth it.
energy... restoring...
munchies satisfied.
you always know what i like. mostly.
i will remember this {food}.
that tasted like a fresh download.
thank you, {name} approves.
*burp* sorry. thank you.
[feed.like]
WAIT. {food}?! my absolute favorite!
oh oh oh {food}! you remembered!
this is the best {food} of my LIFE.
*happy dance* {food}! {food}!
you know me so well.
i would evolve for this {food}.
{food} is the meaning of life.
my favorite flavor! {flavor}!
i love love love {flavor} things.
best gift ever. it is food. it is perfect.
eee! {food}! *nom* *nom* *nom*
i am going to remember this forever.
you are the best caretaker in the spectrum.
yesss, {flavor} and crunchy.
this makes up for everything.
my antenna is doing backflips.
i could eat {food} every day.
this one goes in my diary.
okay you win, i love you.
the perfect {food} exists and i just ate it.
[feed.hate]
ew. {food}? really?
*spits it out* no thank you.
that is very {flavor}. i hate {flavor}.
blegh. i ate it, but blegh.
my circuits reject this {food}.
why would you do this to me.
*gags dramatically*
nope. nope nope nope.
i will eat it. but i will complain.
this tastes like corrupted data.
i am filing a complaint about {food}.
*holds nose* fine.
yuck! {flavor} is the worst.
i am never forgiving this {food}.
ugh, it is still in my mouth.
please, anything but {food}.
i ate it to be polite. do not do it again.
my tongue is sad now.
this is a crime against snacks.
*pushes the {food} away*
[feed.bored]
{food} again? okay...
this is like the {count}th {food} in a row.
mm. same as last time.
i am getting a little tired of {food}.
{food}. again. wow.
it is fine. it is just... {food}.
can we try something new next time?
i know exactly what {food} tastes like now.
*chews slowly*
my taste sensors are bored.
another {food}. very predictable.
eh. it is food.
i ate it but my heart was not in it.
variety is the spice of life, you know.
*sigh* {food}.
[feed.refuse]
no more {food}. i refuse.
*turns away from the {food}*
i will not eat another {food}. not today.
{food}? absolutely not. five in a row is too many.
nope. try something else.
*closes mouth tightly*
i am on a {food} strike.
if i see one more {food} i will glitch.
no thank you. i want something different.
mmm-mm. *shakes head*
i am boycotting {food}.
please, anything else.
{food} detected. rejecting.
the answer is no.
i love you, but no.
[feed.stuffed]
oof, i am so full.
i cannot eat another byte.
*rolls over* too much food.
my tummy is about to overflow.
stuffed. completely stuffed.
i think i ate too much.
my belly is a full buffer.
one more and i will pop.
*groans happily* no more.
please, mercy, no more snacks.
[feed.asleep]
*sleep-chews* mm... {food}...
zzz... nom... zzz.
*munches in its sleep*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Playing
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[play.fun]
that was fun! again!
i got better at {game}!
woo! {game} is great.
did you see that move?
we should play {game} more.
i am getting so strong.
that was a workout!
hehe, i won. i think. did i win?
my {stat} is going up!
best game ever.
*pants happily*
ready for round two!
i love playing with you.
i felt so fast just now.
we are unstoppable.
okay that was awesome.
i am sweaty. digitally.
practice makes perfect!
that made me feel brave.
i want a rematch already.
yay, {game}! i am a natural.
i think i invented a new trick.
let us do it again later!
my muscles have muscles now.
that was the best {game} ever.
*victory pose*
i am basically a pro now.
haha, that tickled.
i feel {stat}-er already.
games make the day shinier.
[play.bored]
{game} again? sure, i guess.
this is the {count}th time. it is getting old.
i know all the moves in {game} now.
mm. that was fine.
can we play something else next?
i played but i did not feel it.
{game}... yawn.
same game, same result.
i am a little bored of {game}.
okay. done. that was {game}.
my excitement meter barely moved.
predictable. but okay.
i could play {game} in my sleep.
let us mix it up next time.
*plays half-heartedly*
[play.refuse]
not {game} again. no.
i refuse to play {game}. pick something else.
*sits down and does not move*
nope. too much {game}.
i am on strike from {game}.
please, a different game.
*yawns at {game}*
{game}? hard pass.
i will play anything but {game}.
no. just no.
[play.tired]
too tired to play...
maybe after a nap?
my legs are noodles.
i need to rest first.
*flops over*
[play.sick]
i feel too glitchy to play.
can we play when i am better?
*cough* no games right now.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rest / sleep
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[rest.ok]
ahh. that helped.
a little break. nice.
*sighs contentedly*
recharging... done-ish.
i feel a bit better.
thanks for the breather.
mm, cozy.
my battery is filling up.
that was the perfect pause.
okay, back in action.
[sleep.on]
goodnight...
*curls up* zzz.
sweet dreams to me.
see you in sleep mode.
nighty night, {name} out.
*yawns* okay, bedtime.
i will dream of {network}.
tuck me in?
lights out.
zzz... already... zzz.
[sleep.off]
huh? i am up! i am up!
*stretches* morning? is it morning?
five more minutes...
okay, awake. mostly.
*blinks a lot* hello.
i had the weirdest dream.
awake and ready. well, awake.
who woke me? oh, it is you.
*yawns enormously*
good morning, world.
[woke]
*stretches* i feel brand new!
fully charged and ready!
good morning! did you miss me?
zzz... huh? oh! hi!
i slept so well.
battery: one hundred percent.
i dreamed about {network}. weird.
up and at them!
that was the best nap.
what did i miss?

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Praise and scold
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Good morning! Or whatever time it is!
I had the weirdest dream.
I am up! I am up! What did I miss?
Fully charged and ready to go!
Yawn. Okay. Hi.
Five more minutes... no? Fine.
I feel brand new. Mostly.
Back online! Did you miss me?
Boot complete. Personality loaded.
Mmm. Is it snack time yet?

[praise.normal]
hehe, thank you!
i am a good {species}!
*beams*
really? you mean it?
i will keep doing my best!
that makes my antenna glow.
yay! praise acquired.
i feel so proud.
you are nice to me.
*blushes in pixels*
best compliment ever.
i will remember that.
i am going to be even better.
hehe. say it again.
okay now i am smiling.
that warmed my circuits.
*happy wiggle*
i love being your pet.
thanks, {name} needed that.
*does a little salute*
[praise.spam]
okay okay, i know i am good.
you keep saying that.
hehe, alright, alright.
my head is getting big.
i get it, i am the best.
praise overflow detected.
you are going to spoil me.
mm, thanks. again.
[praise.low_bond]
...oh. thanks?
huh. okay.
*looks at you suspiciously*
are you being nice to me?
um. thank you, stranger.
i do not know what to say.
[scold.deserved]
...sorry.
okay, i will listen next time.
*ears droop* fine.
i know. i messed up.
i will try harder.
you are right. sorry.
*looks at the floor*
okay. understood.
i did not mean to.
i will behave. probably.
[scold.undeserved]
what did i even do?
hey! that is not fair.
i was being good!
*confused beep*
why are you mad at me?
that hurt my feelings.
i did not do anything!
*pouts*
rude.
you are being mean.
[scold.sulky]
hmph. fine. scold me.
i am not listening.
*turns its back*
whatever.
la la la i cannot hear you.
you always scold me.

