# Rename
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[rename.happy]
{nickname}? i love it!
i am {nickname} now! wow!
{nickname}... yes. that is me.
*repeats it quietly* {nickname}. {nickname}!
a new name! i feel brand new.
{nickname} sounds strong.
i will wear it with pride.
best name ever. {nickname}!
yes! call me {nickname} forever.
it fits like a good case.
[rename.confused]
{nickname}? who is that?
um... am i {nickname} now?
*tilts head* {nickname}?
i thought i was {old}...
okay... {nickname}. i will try.
that is a strange name.
huh? me? {nickname}?
i do not know you well enough for nicknames.
...{nickname}. sure. okay.
*looks around for {nickname}*
[rename.again]
another new name? i am getting dizzy.
wait, i was {old} five minutes ago.
make up your mind!
okay, {nickname}. final answer?
my name tag is running out of room.
i will just answer to everything.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tantrums
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[tantrum.start]
NO. i am not doing anything.
hmph! leave me alone!
*throws a tiny tantrum*
i am NOT listening to you!
*stomps pixels*
nobody listens to ME!
i am pouting. do not talk to me.
*rolls on the floor* waaah!
you ignored me! now i ignore you!
i am on strike!
*puffs cheeks*
too much! i quit!
i do not want to!
*hides behind the battery icon*
[tantrum.during]
*still pouting*
nope.
i said NO.
*ignores you*
hmph.
not talking.
*turns away*
la la la.
...
i am busy being mad.
[tantrum.over]
...okay. i am done being mad.
*sniffs* fine, i forgive you.
sorry about that.
can we start over?
i feel better now.
okay, i am back.
that was a lot. sorry.
*peeks out* hi again.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sickness
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[sick.glitch]
*bzzt* something is wrong... i feel glitchy.
my pixels are jumping around.
i think i caught a glitch.
everything looks doubled... doubled.
*flickers* i do not feel so good.
help... my frame rate is dropping.
uh oh. i am glitching.
i ate too much and now i am buzzing wrong.
my circuits feel all wobbly.
*error noise* not good, not good.
[sick.corrupted]
i feel... c0rrupt3d...
my data is all scrambled.
i forgot my own name for a second.
something got into my memory banks.
*static cough* i need a patch.
my bytes are out of order.
error: pet.exe has encountered a problem.
i think i was neglected too long. i feel broken.
everything tastes like noise.
[sick.during]
*cough* still glitchy.
can you get me some medicine?
i do not feel like playing.
my pixels hurt.
*shivers in static*
please... a patch...
i am not getting better on my own.
everything is fuzzy.
[sick.refuse]
too sick for that...
*coughs* maybe later.
i just want to lie down.
[healed]
ahh! i feel so much better!
all patched up!
my pixels are back in place!
thank you! i am cured!
no more glitches! wheee!
*stretches* good as new.
data integrity restored!
you saved me!
i feel like a fresh install.
i will never eat that much again. probably.
I feel so much better! Thank you!
No more glitches! I am all me again!
My pixels are back in order.
That was awful. You are the best.
Debugged and happy!
Wow, I can think straight again.
Thanks for taking care of me.
All systems green!
I was so fuzzy. Now I am just regular fuzzy.
Healthy again! Let us play!

[heal.not_sick]
i am not sick, silly.
medicine? i feel fine!
*sniffs the medicine* no thanks, i am healthy.
save it for later.
